"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:26","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8070","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:29","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8075","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0007,"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:35","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8080","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:36","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8110","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:37","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"federations2.701","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:51","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-federations2-701"},{"target":"ancrel.4078","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0018,"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:64","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.13030","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:71","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.4006","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0071,"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:90","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.4021","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0071,"group":"r29882","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:104","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"}],"source":{"file":"common/archaeological_site_types/12_extreme_frontiers_arc_sites.txt","line":2},"names":{"from.Planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"extreme_frontiers.1000","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冰封","en":"Frozen Blockage"},"texts":[{"zh":"在寻找[from.Planet.GetName]上的极端低温源时，[leader.GetName]发现了一座远古地下设施的入口。\n\n堵住入口的是一层厚厚的岩石和冰塔，似乎将整座设施封冻了上千年。\n\n入口处干冰的升华从封堵处的许多裂隙升腾出了柱柱白烟。我们的设备显示其中有一座巨大的复合体；[leader.GetName]确信极端冷源就在里面。","en":"While searching for the source of the extremely low temperatures on [from.Planet.GetName], [leader.GetName] has discovered the entrance to an ancient underground structure.\n\nBlocking the entrance is a mass of frozen rock and ice seracs that have likely rendered the structure itself inaccessible for millennia.\n\nMelting carbon dioxide in the entrance is emitting plumes of gas from various gaps in the blockage. Our equipment indicates a vast complex within; [leader.GetName] is confident the source of the extreme cold can be found inside."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/35f06426d24cedb29763.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"extreme_frontiers.1000.a","label":{"zh":"凿穿封堵处","en":"Break through the blockage."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/extreme_frontiers_events.txt","line":2679},"names":{"leader.GetName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"},"from.Planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"extreme_frontiers.1005","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"时光冻结","en":"Frozen in Time"},"texts":[{"zh":"[leader.GetName]成功突破了堵在[from.Planet.GetName]上远古设施入口处的冰层。\n\n在这个空间里有几十具某种未知爬行物种的冻尸。他们扭曲的身体靠着墙被冻结在原地，墙上的爪痕表明他们绝望地试图逃跑。\n\n从入口渗出的干冰烟雾的一定来自地下更深的地方，有一座螺旋形阶梯通向复合体的更深处。","en":"[leader.GetName] has successfully breached the ice blocking the entrance of the ancient structure on [from.Planet.GetName].\n\nInside the space are dozens of frozen corpses belonging to an unknown reptilian race. Their contorted bodies are frozen in place against the walls, with claw marks indicating a desperate attempt to escape.\n\nThe source of the dry ice plumes found seeping through the entrance must be deeper underground, with a spiral stairwell leading further into the complex."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/35f06426d24cedb29763.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"CURIOUS","label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/extreme_frontiers_events.txt","line":2723},"names":{"leader.GetName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"},"from.Planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"extreme_frontiers.1010","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冰封墓穴","en":"Glacial Tomb"},"texts":[{"zh":"在冰封的设施深处，[leader.GetName]发现了原始但理论上可运作的冷冻舱填满了整个中央舱室。\n\n这里表现出的极端严寒远超这些设施所设计的温度范围。这些舱室内的居住者早已死了数千年。\n\n少数没有被冰雪封冻的舱室底部的基柱上还能看得清一些字，写的是里面的人的社会头衔和等级。等级越高的的舱室越靠近一个深埋在冰霜中的巨大中央荚舱。","en":"Deeper in the frozen complex, [leader.GetName] has uncovered a large central chamber filled with primitive but theoretically functional cryogenic chambers.\n\nThe extreme cold present here far exceeds the designed temperature ranges of these devices. The occupants of the pods have died thousands of years ago.\n\nWhat few chambers have not been reclaimed by ice and snow have readable plinths at the base, denoting the social title and rank of those contained within. The higher ranked chambers are positioned closest to a large central pod, which is itself deeply embedded in frost and snow."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/05bea11626b645c142f9.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"extreme_frontiers.1010.a","label":{"zh":"调查中央舱。","en":"Investigate the central pod."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/extreme_frontiers_events.txt","line":2767},"names":{"leader.GetName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"}}},{"id":"extreme_frontiers.1015","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冰封君王","en":"Frozen Monarch"},"texts":[{"zh":"[leader.GetName]破开了[from.Planet.GetName]上冰封墓穴中央的大舱。\n\n在其中我们发现的是一个远古王室首领的安息之地，这一点在之前的舱室中发现的文本有提及。和他一起冻眠的还有几十个随从，而他自己的冷冻舱隆重地装饰着外墙。\n\n这位死去君王的高科技石棺通过迷宫般的管道和电路与一台古老的机器相连。这太装置被嵌在一大块冰中，它的温度低到危险的程度，连分析设备都无法承受。\n\n这台设备的故障的原因以及它与行星冰冻核心的关系仍有待进一步研究。","en":"[leader.GetName] has breached the large central pod at the heart of the glacial tomb on [from.Planet.GetName].\n\nInside we discovered the final resting place of the head of the ancient royal house hinted at in the texts of the previous chamber. Frozen alongside are dozens of their retainers whose own cryopods adorn the walls in ceremonial fashion.\n\nThe dead ruler's technological sarcophagus is connected via a labyrinthine network of tubes and circuitry to an ancient machine. This device is embedded into a large body of ice, the temperature of which approaches dangerously low levels to even our analysis equipment.\n\nWhat caused the apparent malfunction of this facility and its relationship to the planet's frozen core requires more study."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/05bea11626b645c142f9.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"extreme_frontiers.1015.a","label":{"zh":"这里出了什么事？","en":"What went wrong here?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/extreme_frontiers_events.txt","line":2811},"names":{"leader.GetName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"},"from.Planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"extreme_frontiers.1020","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"低温灾难","en":"Cryogenic Catastrophe"},"texts":[{"zh":"对[from.Planet.GetName]上冰封墓穴中央舱室的分析解释了这场灾难发生的缘由。\n\n冷冻机械装置是使用亚热动力学，利用了行星极低的核心温度。在君王感染了绝症之后，人们希望能在治疗方法问世时唤醒王室的随从。\n\n尽管理论像那么回事，但当独特设计的循环介质泄漏到行星核心时，吸热反应失控了。随之而来的致命降温迅速冻结了整座设施。\n\n我们采纳了他们最初的理论，并加以改进，在专门用于冰封星球的先进低温技术方面取得了突破。","en":"Analysis of the glacial tomb's central chamber on [from.Planet.GetName] has revealed the origin of the disaster that unfolded.\n\nThe cryogenic machinery makes use of subthermal dynamics which take advantage of this planet's extremely low core temperatures. After the monarch was infected with a terminal disease, the hope was to reawaken the royal retinue when a cure was discovered.\n\nWhile their theory was sound, a runaway endothermic reaction occurred when their uniquely engineered circulation medium leaked into the planetary core. This triggered a fatal temperature drop which quickly flash-froze the entire facility.\n\nWe have taken their initial theory and improved upon it, achieving a breakthrough in advanced cryogenic technology specialized for use on frozen worlds."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/05bea11626b645c142f9.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"EXCELLENT","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/extreme_frontiers_events.txt","line":2855},"names":{"from.Planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}}]}